@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - NexStar Control</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <h1>🔭 SpawnDev.NexStar</h1>
    
    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>About</h2>
        <p>
            <strong>SpawnDev.NexStar</strong> provides tools to communicate with and control 
            Celestron NexStar telescopes using the Web Serial API in Blazor WebAssembly.
        </p>
        <p>
            This library is built on top of <a href="https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.SpawnJS" target="_blank">SpawnDev.SpawnJS</a>, 
            which provides full JavaScript interop for Blazor WebAssembly applications.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Supported Telescopes</h2>
        <p>The library supports telescopes using the NexStar Communication Protocol, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>NexStar SLT Series</strong> (including SLT 127)</li>
            <li>NexStar SE Series (4/5/6/8 SE)</li>
            <li>NexStar GPS Series</li>
            <li>Advanced GT</li>
            <li>Advanced VX</li>
            <li>CGE / CGEM</li>
            <li>CPC Series</li>
            <li>NexStar Evolution</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>🔌 Web Serial API connection via USB-to-Serial adapter</li>
            <li>📍 Get/Set telescope position (RA/Dec and Az/Alt)</li>
            <li>🎯 GoTo commands with standard and precise (sub-arcsecond) accuracy</li>
            <li>🕹 Manual slewing with variable rates</li>
            <li>🔄 Tracking mode control (Off, Alt-Az, EQ North/South)</li>
            <li>⏱ Time and date synchronization</li>
            <li>🌍 Location configuration</li>
            <li>✅ Alignment status monitoring</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Requirements</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>A Chromium-based browser (Chrome, Edge) with Web Serial API support</li>
            <li>USB-to-Serial adapter (e.g., Prolific PL2303)</li>
            <li>RS-232 cable connected to telescope hand controller</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Links</h2>
        <div class="link-grid">
            <a href="https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.NexStar" target="_blank" class="link-card">
                <span class="icon">📦</span>
